        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Metadata Injection: The Hidden TTP Attackers Might Use to Fool Your AI Triage & Investigation]]></title>
        <id>https://www.stream.security/post/metadata-injection-the-hidden-ttp-attackers-might-use-to-fool-your-ai-triage-investigation</id>
        <link href="https://www.stream.security/post/metadata-injection-the-hidden-ttp-attackers-might-use-to-fool-your-ai-triage-investigation"/>
